Z||000011||Jay||08-18-2001||12:50 PM||||Spoke to a cop at the drag strip last week.  As long as the bulb is the correct color (red for brake, amber for turn) there is no problem.  It is illegal to have a different color bulb, say blue for instance as brake light.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cayuga3_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
