Z||000024||b lo 0||08-19-2001||10:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiaddict:<BR><B>Will the black grate pieces fit back into the taillights with the red and clear parts taken out? Or will it just flop around?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>The black grates and the color peices are one and the same.  You'd have to make new grates if you want the look.  Sorry  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.  BTW, I recommend cleaning the lens and bucket real good with household cleaner like 409 so it'll look better.<BR>||||reg||1
